WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.050
The Real Question.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.250
ArriveCAN is not a technology story.

00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:07.662
It is a procurement story.

00:00:07.662 --> 00:00:12.325
The app was a simple web form that any developer could build in a weekend.

00:00:12.325 --> 00:00:21.687
The question is how did 40 contract amendments get approved without anyone asking why an 80,000 dollar project costs 59.5 million?

00:00:21.687 --> 00:00:26.212
Emergency COVID procurement rules bypassed normal oversight.
